flowchart LR
    Device["Thiết bị theo dõi"] -->|Rawdata / status / events / firmware| Broker["EMQX"]
    Broker -->|Subscribe| Bridge["MQTT Bridge"]
    Bridge -->|Ghi telemetry| VictoriaMetricsNode["VictoriaMetrics"]
    Bridge -->|Ghi log| VictoriaLogsNode["VictoriaLogs"]
    Bridge -->|Cập nhật trạng thái / session| PostgreSQLNode["PostgreSQL"]
    Bridge -->|Publish internal/events/#| Broker
    Broker -->|Realtime listener| API["Backend API"]
    Dash["Giao diện web"] -->|REST request| API
    API -->|Socket.IO| Dash["Giao diện web"]
    API -->|Publish topic commands| Broker
    Broker -->|Commands| Device

